# Stable spec ID: difford-hemingway-daiquiri. Source checked 2026-10-13. Machine generated; not human reviewed or taste-tested.

::ingredients
(rum; light gold, 1-3 years old molasses column) 3 1/2 fl oz
(juice, pink grapefruit) 1 fl oz
(maraschino liqueur @ Luxardo) 3/4 fl oz
(lime: juice, fresh) 1 fl oz
(simple syrup, 2:1 sugar to water; 65.0°Brix) 1/2 fl oz

::equipment
(cocktail shaker)
(mesh strainer)
(cocktail glass, large 10oz)

::instructions
<shake, measured ingredients with ice in (cocktail shaker)>
<fine-strain, into a chilled (cocktail glass, large 10oz)>
<garnish, with a Luxardo maraschino cherry and/or a lime wedge or wheel>

::notes
This records one source-specific version; no universal formula or automatic product substitution is implied.
Source describes this as one oversized serve or two ordinary coupe serves. This is the displayed sweetened formula, not the separate El Floridita recipe lower on that page.

